<!-- ═══════════════════════  HEADER  ═══════════════════════ -->
<div class="report-header">
  <div class="container" style="padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0;">
    <div class="meta-tag">Government Policy Report &nbsp;·&nbsp; Restricted</div>
    <h1>UK Retail Fuel Price Trend Analysis<br>February – April 2026</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">A comprehensive analysis of retail fuel pricing patterns across UK forecourts, examining price distributions by fuel type, market competitiveness, and retailer reporting compliance based on government-mandated open data.</p>
