      <p class="section-intro">
        This dataset comprises <span class="hl">50,000 price observations</span> drawn from the UK Government's Fuel Finder scheme, spanning <span class="hl">7 February to 16 April 2026</span> — a period of approximately 10 weeks. Source price update timestamps extend back to <span class="hl">17 December 2025</span>, reflecting older price reports that were still active during the collection window. The data represents <span class="hl">7,373 unique forecourts</span> across England, Scotland, and Wales. No null values were detected across any column.
      </p>

      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <table class="stats-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Metric</th>
                <th>Value</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
